<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Shanghai Ind.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets warrants on Shanghai Ind.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Monday it issued 123 million American-style call warrants on shares of Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$22.25	  PREMIUM	  20.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.445	  GEARING	  5.0x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  18.NOV.97	 PAYDATE	  2.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   4.DEC.96</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$22.25</p>
<p>NOTES: CASH SETTLEMENT OF EXERCISE AMOUNT PAYABLE IN HONG KONG DOLLARS OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
